storage seam — reindex's check-then-act window). Fingerprint moved
with the kind reorder (see above); live legs still unexecuted.

**Status (2026-09-07, ROUND 12 — the prepare-branch `--main` pass over
the whole v0.4.0..HEAD wave; 25 verified findings fixed, all with
