tracking + a cursor ceiling); reindex overwrote concurrent writes with
no version precondition (optimistic LSN recheck + a `superseded`
count); a cross-repo closing reference overwrote local issue identity
(composite repo#number identity); and every Dreams cycle rewrote its
committed abstraction rows, with rollback deleting them (idempotency
now consults storage). Plus 19 advisories: git-adapter wide-commit
livelock and unbounded history read (bounded slicing mapper + the
streamed `--max-commits` read bound — the second wave's wording), untimed
api-client bodies + per-request TLS + token echo, SimilarTo hints
leaking scoped titles, non-deterministic cross-domain capping over a
full working-set clone, the deleted exhaustive kind-sync pin, README
kind 7 + the rewrap remnants, D5's missing operator surface
(`EXOCORTEX_INGEST_SIMILARITY_SEEDING`), the three-node fan-out test
that never touched nodes b/c, the CLI's wrong-shape chain/related
rendering, and the invisible live-leg skips in CI. One new deferral
recorded: **R12-D1 stale-abstraction retirement** (PRUNE cannot see
General-carried rows in typed regions; v2). The loop is NOT at a
verified-clean exit — iteration 6 is next. Release note: live
FALKOR/REDIS/POSTGRES/Linear legs remain unexecuted (URLs/key unset).

